@startuml
title agent-auth-sdk × OpenAI SDK：多 Agent 代码审查协作

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

<style>
  participant { Padding 28 }
  box { Padding 10 }
</style>

autonumber

actor "用户" as User
participant "Console\n(Web UI)" as Console
participant "Coordinator\n(8101)" as Coord
participant "Vault" as Vault
participant "Registry" as Registry
participant "Specialist\n(8102-8105)" as Spec
participant "LLM API\n(OpenAI-compat)" as LLM

== 启动：Agent 身份注册 ==

Coord -> Vault : from_vault(domain, name, auto_create_key=True)
Vault --> Coord : public_key
Coord -> Coord : 构建 AgentInstance\n(agent-auth-sdk)
Coord -> Vault : 签名 publish 请求
Vault --> Coord : signature
Coord -> Registry : publish(client_id, api_key)
Registry --> Coord : owner 绑定成功

Spec -> Vault : from_vault(…)
Vault --> Spec : public_key
Spec -> Vault : 签名 publish 请求
Vault --> Spec : signature
Spec -> Registry : publish(client_id, api_key)
Registry --> Spec : owner 绑定成功

note over Coord, Registry
5 个 Agent 各自从 Vault 创建身份并发布到 Registry。
每次重启时 SDK 自动完成上述流程。
end note

== 用户提交代码审查 ==

User -> Console : 粘贴代码 + 提交
Console -> Coord : POST /reviews/submit\n{title, code}

== Coordinator：LLM 预分析 ==

Coord -> LLM : analyze_code_submission(code)\n(AsyncOpenAI)
LLM --> Coord : language / complexity / summary

note over Coord, LLM
OpenAI SDK 调用：通过 OpenAI 兼容 API 进行代码初步分析。
失败时回退到 shared/rules.py 本地规则引擎。
end note

== Coordinator：签名并分发任务 ==

Coord -> Vault : sign_http(method, url, body)
Vault --> Coord : x-agent-* headers
Coord -> Spec : POST /tasks/handle\n+ x-agent-* 签名 headers\n(action: review_architecture / security / …)

== Specialist：验签 + 领域分析 + 签名返回 ==

Spec -> Registry : resolve_agent(agent_id)
Registry --> Spec : AgentMetadata + public_key
Spec -> Spec : verify_http_request()\n校验 timestamp / nonce / signature
Spec -> Spec : 能力校验（capability check）

alt 验签通过
    Spec -> LLM : review_security(code, context)\n(AsyncOpenAI)
    LLM --> Spec : findings + score + summary
    Spec -> Vault : sign_message(result)\nrecipient=coordinator
    Vault --> Spec : SignedAgentMessage
    Spec --> Coord : SignedAgentMessage{payload, signature}
else 验签失败
    Spec --> Coord : 401 拒绝
end

note over Spec, LLM
每个 Specialist 调用 OpenAI SDK 进行各自领域的分析，
返回前用 sign_message() 签名结果，防止响应篡改。
LLM 调用失败时回退到规则引擎。
end note

Coord -> Coord : 汇总验签后的结果
Coord -> LLM : synthesize_report(all_results)\n(AsyncOpenAI)
LLM --> Coord : overall_score + risk_items + recommendations
Coord --> Console : review_id + report
Console --> User : 展示审查结果

note over User, LLM
完整双向签名：Coordinator → Specialist（sign_http + verify_http_request）
Specialist → Coordinator（sign_message + verify_agent_message）。
agent-auth-sdk 负责身份认证与请求完整性，
OpenAI SDK 负责代码智能分析。
end note

@enduml
